# Skyramp testbot: the Docker executor writes root-owned Playwright videos
# under nested .skyramp/videos dirs (e.g. frontend/), which break the
# side-PR git stash. Ignore ONLY nested dirs — the top-level
# .skyramp/videos/ is referenced explicitly by testbot's own stash
# pathspec, and git errors out if an explicitly-named path is ignored.
*/.skyramp/videos/
